  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIGITALIZATION OF STATE RECORDS AND FILES IN PUBLIC SERVICES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The management of documents and files becomes fundamental in the search for efficiency and effectiveness in the provision of services, since a management model will allow locating the requested information in a timely manner to contribute to decision-making.

The Digitizing Documents and Archives in Public Administration project aims to ensure the preservation of institutional memory and guarantee access to information of public interest. This project aims to digitize the collections of the following institutions:
&#x2022;	Television of Mozambique;
&#x2022;	Radio Mozambique;
&#x2022;	National Documentation and Information Center of Mozambique; It is,
&#x2022;	National Institute of Culture and Creative Industries.</narrative>
  </description>
